@startuml
title Organizer – Take Attendance
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #154a9b
  ParticipantBorderColor #154a9b
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #edf3fc
  GroupBorderColor #8a9eb8
  LifeLineBorderColor #8a9eb8
}

actor "Organizer" as U
boundary "User Interface" as UI
control "Attendance API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Background Processing\nOutbox / RabbitMQ / Worker" as BG

U -> UI : 1: Choose direction and status; enter student code
alt [Barcode scanner]
  UI -> UI : 1.1: Detect input and auto-submit
else [Manual input]
  U -> UI : 1.2: Press Enter to submit
end

UI -> API : 2: Submit student code, source and status
activate API
API -> API : 2.1: Validate permission, event scope,\nattendance direction and service availability
break [Invalid request or service unavailable]
  API --> UI : 2.2: Return error
  UI --> U : 2.3: Display error
end
alt [STAFF_BARCODE]
  API -> DB : 2.4: Find actively registered student
else [MANUAL_ENTRY]
  API -> DB : 2.5: Find student; registration not required
end
break [Student or required registration not found]
  API --> UI : 2.6: Reject request
end
API -> DB : 2.7: Save PENDING request + Outbox\nin one transaction
break [Persistence fails]
  API --> UI : 2.8: Return error; request not accepted
end
API --> UI : 2.9: 202 – Accepted for processing
deactivate API

BG -> DB : 3: Relay reads Outbox; delivers request\nvia RabbitMQ to worker
BG -> DB : 3.1: Worker revalidates conditions\n(MANUAL_ENTRY bypasses registration)
alt [Validation passes]
  BG -> DB : 3.2: Record attendance if absent;\nsave ACCEPTED + processed Outbox
  BG -> DB : 3.3: Sync Conduct Score after commit
else [Validation fails]
  BG -> DB : 3.4: Save REJECTED, reason\nand processed Outbox
end
BG ->> API : 3.5: Publish result via Redis Pub/Sub
API ->> UI : 4: Notify change via SSE
UI -> API : 4.1: Refresh list on the current page
API -> DB : 4.2: Read requests within authorized scope
DB --> API : 4.3: Request list
API --> UI : 4.4: Return result
UI --> U : 4.5: Display attendance status

note over U,API
  Direct attendance requires neither GPS nor a QR session.
  The hook infers input source from typing speed.
  Opening a QR session is a separate action; see the detailed diagram.
end note
@enduml
